+Abstract  Existing
+Graph Signal Processing (GSP)-based recommender
+systems do not
+explicitly
+incorporate
+user
+ratings
+when
+constructing
+interaction
+graphs.
+We
+propose
+Rating-Aware
+Graph
+Filtering. The method independently filters interaction-based and rating-based adjacency matrices and
+combines their outputs through weighted aggregation. Experiments on ML-100K, ML-Latest-Small,
